# sdist manifest. Without this, setuptools' legacy default pulled tests/test_*.py into
# the sdist while omitting tests/__init__.py, conftest.py, and tests/golden/ — a broken
# half-copy of the suite. Tests need a Mac + a source-built Triton anyway, so exclude
# them (and other repo-only dirs) from the sdist entirely; the wheel was always clean.
prune tests
prune docs
prune benchmarks
prune reports
prune examples
prune third_party
prune scripts
prune .github
# Retain the notice while excluding repository-only tests and third-party code.
# PEP 639 also carries it into the wheel's dist-info/licenses directory.
include third_party/trifast/LICENSE
